# Known-bad stand-in write: a record with a mode and no provenance method.
# Expected: a SHACL rejection naming sis:RecordModeMethodShape-method
# (node shape sis:RecordModeMethodShape), sh:MinCountConstraintComponent.
# {{RUN}} must be replaced before posting (bin/write.sh does it; with curl see README §3), else HTTP 502 "Invalid IRI value".
@prefix rec: <urn:ontara:standin:rec#> .
<urn:ontara:standin:cafe#bad-{{RUN}}> a rec:PlatformRecord ;
  rec:hasRealityMode rec:RealMode .
